	"description": "Channel bumper using the cylinder-axis-y variant: 'SYNTAX' wraps onto a Y-axis cylinder that spins 90° across the 6-second timeline. Back-facing glyphs self-occlude; front-facing glyphs attenuate by cos(angle) producing a smooth brightness falloff toward the cylinder sides. The active Pack pairs the glyph ink with its full-frame field. Demonstrates the text-3d pipeline's per-glyph lighting and self-occlusion — geometry impossible with CSS 3D on a flat plane.",
